+The Company uses Cloudflare, Inc.'s Turnstile for Contact Us security verification. When the inquiry page loads and security verification takes place, information such as the IP address, browser User-Agent, TLS fingerprint, sitekey and associated origin may be transmitted over the network to and processed by Cloudflare. Cloudflare provides website protection to the Company and separately processes information to improve Turnstile's bot detection capabilities. Cloudflare's privacy contact is dpo@cloudflare.com. Cloudflare states that visitor-related metadata is processed in its data centers in the United States and Europe and retained for a limited period necessary for the purposes of processing. The specific retention period is determined by whether the purpose has been achieved and by retention obligations under applicable law.
